{
  "id": "20th-anniversary-festa",
  "name": "20th Anniversary Festa",
  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "The Pokémon Card Game 20th Anniversary Festa was held at Toki Messe in Niigata on 10 October 2016 and at Nagoya's Fukiage Hall on 23 October 2016. Three straight wins in the Premier Stage of its 20th Anniversary Battle earned a holo basic Energy in the first series' design and a place in the Climax Stage, and the top three of each league won Victory Ring in gold, silver or bronze in a 20th-anniversary design. Each member of the winning team in the Shōwa VS Heisei Battle, players born in the Shōwa era against those born in Heisei, got a holo Teammates, and Play Points from the events bought prizes: a Gym Badge for two points, Magikarp for four, Mewtwo-EX for six, and Pikachu or Mew for twelve.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon Card Game official site: 20th Anniversary Festa",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon-card.com/20th/event/20th-festa/"
      },
